@startuml SEQ_08_MENGELOLA_TUGAS
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-08: Mengelola Tugas Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten"          as User
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "TugasPraktikumController" as Controller
entity      "TugasPraktikum Model"     as Model
database    "tugas_praktikum"          as DB

== Lihat Daftar Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Tugas" di halaman praktikum
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/tugas
Controller -> Model    : Query tugas berdasarkan praktikum
Model -> DB            : SELECT tugas_praktikum WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB --> Model           : Data tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar tugas
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan daftar tugas

== Tambah Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Tambah Tugas"
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/tugas\n{judul, deadline, bobot_nilai, file?}
Controller -> Model    : create({praktikum_id, judul, deskripsi, deadline, bobot_nilai, file_path})
Model -> DB            : INSERT INTO tugas_praktikum
DB --> Model           : Data tugas baru
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas baru
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tugas baru muncul di daftar

== Edit Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Edit" pada tugas, ubah detail / ganti file
Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/tugas/{id} {judul, deskripsi, deadline, bobot_nilai, file?}
Controller -> Model    : update({judul, deskripsi, deadline, bobot_nilai, file_path})
Model -> DB            : UPDATE tugas_praktikum SET ... WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Berhasil
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Data tugas ter-update

== Hapus Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Hapus", konfirmasi
Browser ->  Controller : DELETE /praktikum/tugas/{id}
Controller -> Model    : delete()
Model -> DB            : DELETE FROM tugas_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Berhasil
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tugas hilang dari daftar

== Download / View File Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik tombol "Download" atau "Preview" pada tugas
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/download
Controller -> Model    : Query tugas
Model -> DB            : SELECT tugas_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Data tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser : Download atau stream file
Browser --> User       : File diunduh / ditampilkan

@enduml
